七十有悬车之礼今已六十八可以去矣、固辞疾逊位","evidence":["huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"皆手诏嘉纳、终不许","evidence":["huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f","source_order":[22,403,53],"order":4592},{"id":"huanchen-e-o083","title":"宣青龙四年薨赠车骑将军","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-d27b8b21f1e3abef15e7","label":"正文","text":"宣青龙四年薨赠车骑将军","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"huanchen-p0021","role":"薨、遗令布衣疏巾敛以时服、谥曰贞侯","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"诏曰宣体履至实直内方外、历在三朝公亮正色有托孤寄命之节、可谓柱石臣也、常欲倚以台辅未及登之、其追赠车骑将军葬如公礼","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a","source_order":[22,404,0],"order":4593}],"persons":[{"id":"huanchen-p0021","name":"徐宣","evidence":["huanchen-q-06d8eedae584702c9ce5","huanchen-q-48fc9e04f87b577558a0","huanchen-q-480242d9f7caa18abec0","huanchen-q-f29f4dde922aa285fa7c","huanchen-q-313771b2691f7a855662","huanchen-q-274b1928bfd503fb9d06","huanchen-q-422aeb478c32edd26a7c","huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e","huanchen-q-3cd6d0f78a25d43380fb","huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f","huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a","huanchen-q-338b616d681073bad3ce"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"huanchen-m-f380c1efb47b102f7297","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及徐宣","evidence":["huanchen-q-2929c6b6b5c74f0fdd1a"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-06d8eedae584702c9ce5","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-76f5b2a0b26b5519ef32","layer":"original","quote":"海西、淮浦二县民作乱〖4〗；都尉卫弥、令梁习夜奔宣家〖5〗，密送免之","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":75,"end":109},{"id":"huanchen-q-1d32e558174983e6e49f","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-d7594b71d329a5dcf25b","layer":"original","quote":"尚方令坐猥见考竟〖13〗，宣上疏陈威刑太过；又谏作宫殿穷尽民力：帝皆手诏嘉纳。宣曰：“七十有悬车之礼〖14〗；今已六十八，可以去矣。”乃固辞疾逊位，帝终不许","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":131},{"id":"huanchen-q-274b1928bfd503fb9d06","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-0568ef64d2093929ff52","layer":"original","quote":"帝既践阼，为御史中丞，赐爵关内侯。徙城门校尉〖1〗，旬月迁司隶校尉","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"huanchen-q-2929c6b6b5c74f0fdd1a","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-c244875cc30f324b80d0","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：桓阶识睹成败，才周当世〖1〗。陈群动仗名义，有清流雅望；泰弘济简至〖2〗，允克堂构矣〖3〗。魏世事统台阁〖4〗，重内轻外；故八座尚书〖5〗，即古六卿之任也〖6〗。陈、徐、卫、卢，久居斯位；矫、宣刚断骨鲠；臻、毓规鉴清理：咸不忝厥职云","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":604,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119},{"id":"huanchen-q-313771b2691f7a855662","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-17e729ea94fa793eb291","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩洛阳，群臣入殿中发哀。或言“可易诸城守〖12〗，用谯、沛人〖13〗。”宣厉声曰：“今者远近一统，人怀效节；何必谯、沛，而沮宿卫者心！”文帝闻曰：“所谓社稷之臣也","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":83},{"id":"huanchen-q-338b616d681073bad3ce","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-f9b7ba3bdaeea945b1ff","layer":"pei","quote":"本刘氏子，出嗣舅氏，而婚于本族。徐宣每非之，庭议其阙。太祖惜矫才量，欲拥全之，乃下令曰：‘屯乱以来，风教凋薄；谤议之言，难用褒贬。自建安五年以前，一切勿论。其以断前诽议者，以其罪罪之","attribution":"裴注·《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d26318cb3bc48e0576f8","start":14,"end":105},{"id":"huanchen-q-3cd6d0f78a25d43380fb","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-d7594b71d329a5dcf25b","layer":"original","quote":"车驾幸许昌，总统留事〖10〗。帝还，主者奏呈文书〖11〗。诏曰：“吾省与仆射〔省〕何异〖12〗？”竟不视","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"huanchen-q-422aeb478c32edd26a7c","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-0568ef64d2093929ff52","layer":"original","quote":"转散骑常侍，从至广陵，六军乘舟；风浪暴起，帝船回倒〖2〗；宣病在后，陵波而前，群僚莫先至者。帝壮之，迁尚书","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":34,"end":87},{"id":"huanchen-q-480242d9f7caa18abec0","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-960bf572e51e4b326d15","layer":"original","quote":"太祖辟为司空掾属。除东缗、发干令〖8〗。迁齐郡太守。入为门下督，从到寿春〖9〗。","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"huanchen-q-48fc9e04f87b577558a0","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-76f5b2a0b26b5519ef32","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遣督军扈质来讨贼〖6〗，以兵少不进。宣潜见责之〖7〗，示以形势，质乃进破贼","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":110,"end":149},{"id":"huanchen-q-4acbb5c10c9b6ecef60e","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9a7fe236edb28f433514","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，封津阳亭侯，邑二百户。中领军桓范荐宣曰〖3〗：“臣闻帝王用人，度世授才〖4〗：争夺之时，以策略为先；分定之后〖5〗，以忠义为首。故晋文行舅犯之计，而赏雍季之言〖6〗；﹝一﹞高祖用陈平之智，而托后于周勃也〖7〗。窃见尚书徐宣，体忠厚之行，秉直亮之性；清雅特立，不（拘）〔随〕世俗；确然难动〖8〗，有社稷之节；历位州郡，所在称职。今仆射缺，宣行掌后事；腹心任重，莫宜宣者〖9〗。”帝遂以宣为左仆射。后加侍中、光禄大夫","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":211},{"id":"huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-cb334bb1f97752ceda00","layer":"original","quote":"青龙四年，薨；遗令布衣疏巾〖15〗，敛以时服〖16〗。诏曰：“宣体履至实，直内方外；历在三朝〖17〗，公亮正色，有托孤寄命之节。可谓柱石臣也。常欲倚以台辅〖18〗；未及登之〖19〗，惜乎大命不永！其追赠车骑将军，葬如公礼〖20〗。”谥曰贞侯。子钦嗣","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124},{"id":"huanchen-q-9e21d4224b0d0102352f","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-76f5b2a0b26b5519ef32","layer":"original","quote":"避乱江东。又辞孙策之命，还本郡，与陈矫并为纲纪〖2〗。二人齐名，而私好不协；然俱见器于太守陈登〖3〗，与登并心于太祖","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":74},{"id":"huanchen-q-f29f4dde922aa285fa7c","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-960bf572e51e4b326d15","layer":"original","quote":"会马超作乱〖10〗，大军西征。太祖见官属曰：“今当远征，而此方未定，以为后忧；宜得清公大德，以镇统之。”乃以宣为左护军〖11〗，留统诸军。还，为丞相东曹掾，出为魏郡太守","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":40,"end":124}],"profiles":{"huanchen-p0021":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"wei"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
